   "date": "2026-07-23",
   "title": "【関市】「第44回 関市ふるさと夏まつり」が7月25日に開催！「関の工場参観日 夏まつり」も同日実施",
   "html": "<p>関市の夏を彩る恒例イベント「<a href=\"https://seki-akindo.com/news/syoten/detail/42/\" target=\"_blank\">第44回 関市ふるさと夏まつり</a>」が、2026年7月25日（土）に関市本町通りで開催されます。</p>\n<p>開催日：2026年7月25日（土）<br />\n時間：15:00～20:00</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_37103\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-37103\" class=\"wp-image-37103 size-full\" src=\"https://kani.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/257/2026/07/6120015656a4747e56ffb7.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"914\" srcset=\"https://kani.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/257/2026/07/6120015656a4747e56ffb7.jpg 1280w, https://kani.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/257/2026/07/6120015656a4747e56ffb7-768x548.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-37103\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">画像提供：協同組合せき商連様</p></div>\n<p>当日は商店街が歩行者天国となり、さま ざまな催しでにぎわいます。</p>\n<p>会場では、ステージパフォーマンスや音楽ライブ、パレードをはじめ、子ども向けの縁日や屋台、グルメブースなどが登場。人気の「もち菓子まき」のほか、自衛隊車両の展示、DJパフォーマンス、盆踊りなど、幅広い世代が楽しめる企画が予定されています。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_37102\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-37102\" class=\"wp-image-37102 size-full\" src=\"https://kani.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/257/2026/07/16817500506a4748d73626d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"914\" srcset=\"https://kani.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/257/2026/07/16817500506a4748d73626d.jpg 1280w, https://kani.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/257/2026/07/16817500506a4748d73626d-768x548.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-37102\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">画像提供：協同組合せき商連様</p></div>\n<p>また、同日には「関の工場参観日 夏まつり」も開催。</p>\n<p>せきてらすを会場に、市内の工場や企業が企画したものづくり体験やワークショップが楽しめます。子どもから大人まで参加できる体験がそろい、関市ならではのものづくりの魅力に触れられるイベントです。</p>\n<blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DZocF2ZCtUQ/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"14\" style=\" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:500px; min-width:326px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);\">\n<div style=\"padding:16px;\"> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DZocF2ZCtUQ/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" style=\" background:#FFFFFF; line-height:0; padding:0 0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; width:100%;\" target=\"_blank\"> </p>\n<div style=\" display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\">\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\"></div>\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 19% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display:block; height:50px; margin:0 auto 12px; width:50px;\"><svg width=\"50px\" height=\"50px\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"https://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><g transform=\"translate(-511.000000, -20.000000)\" fill=\"#000000\"><g><path d=\"M556.869,30.41 C554.814,30.41 553.148,32.076 553.148,34.131 C553.148,36.186 554.814,37.852 556.869,37.852 C558.924,37.852 560.59,36.186 560.59,34.131 C560.59,32.076 558.924,30.41 556.869,30.41 M541,60.657 C535.114,60.657 530.342,55.887 530.342,50 C530.342,44.114 535.114,39.342 541,39.342 C546.887,39.342 551.658,44.114 551.658,50 C551.658,55.887 546.887,60.657 541,60.657 M541,33.886 C532.1,33.886 524.886,41.1 524.886,50 C524.886,58.899 532.1,66.113 541,66.113 C549.9,66.113 557.115,58.899 557.115,50 C557.115,41.1 549.9,33.886 541,33.886 M565.378,62.101 C565.244,65.022 564.756,66.606 564.346,67.663 C563.803,69.06 563.154,70.057 562.106,71.106 C561.058,72.155 560.06,72.803 558.662,73.347 C557.607,73.757 556.021,74.244 553.102,74.378 C549.944,74.521 548.997,74.552 541,74.552 C533.003,74.552 532.056,74.521 528.898,74.378 C525.979,74.244 524.393,73.757 523.338,73.347 C521.94,72.803 520.942,72.155 519.894,71.106 C518.846,70.057 518.197,69.06 517.654,67.663 C517.244,66.606 516.755,65.022 516.623,62.101 C516.479,58.943 516.448,57.996 516.448,50 C516.448,42.003 516.479,41.056 516.623,37.899 C516.755,34.978 517.244,33.391 517.654,32.338 C518.197,30.938 518.846,29.942 519.894,28.894 C520.942,27.846 521.94,27.196 523.338,26.654 C524.393,26.244 525.979,25.756 528.898,25.623 C532.057,25.479 533.004,25.448 541,25.448 C548.997,25.448 549.943,25.479 553.102,25.623 C556.021,25.756 557.607,26.244 558.662,26.654 C560.06,27.196 561.058,27.846 562.106,28.894 C563.154,29.942 563.803,30.938 564.346,32.338 C564.756,33.391 565.244,34.978 565.378,37.899 C565.522,41.056 565.552,42.003 565.552,50 C565.552,57.996 565.522,58.943 565.378,62.101 M570.82,37.631 C570.674,34.438 570.167,32.258 569.425,30.349 C568.659,28.377 567.633,26.702 565.965,25.035 C564.297,23.368 562.623,22.342 560.652,21.575 C558.743,20.834 556.562,20.326 553.369,20.18 C550.169,20.033 549.148,20 541,20 C532.853,20 531.831,20.033 528.631,20.18 C525.438,20.326 523.257,20.834 521.349,21.575 C519.376,22.342 517.703,23.368 516.035,25.035 C514.368,26.702 513.342,28.377 512.574,30.349 C511.834,32.258 511.326,34.438 511.181,37.631 C511.035,40.831 511,41.851 511,50 C511,58.147 511.035,59.17 511.181,62.369 C511.326,65.562 511.834,67.743 512.574,69.651 C513.342,71.625 514.368,73.296 516.035,74.965 C517.703,76.634 519.376,77.658 521.349,78.425 C523.257,79.167 525.438,79.673 528.631,79.82 C531.831,79.965 532.853,80.001 541,80.001 C549.148,80.001 550.169,79.965 553.369,79.82 C556.562,79.673 558.743,79.167 560.652,78.425 C562.623,77.658 564.297,76.634 565.965,74.965 C567.633,73.296 568.659,71.625 569.425,69.651 C570.167,67.743 570.674,65.562 570.82,62.369 C570.966,59.17 571,58.147 571,50 C571,41.851 570.966,40.831 570.82,37.631\"></path></g></g></g></svg></div>\n<div style=\"padding-top: 8px;\">\n<div style=\" color:#3897f0; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:550; line-height:18px;\">View this post on Instagram</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 12.5% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: 8px;\">\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\"></div>\n<div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg)\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: auto;\">\n<div style=\" width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"></div>\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"></div>\n<div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\"></div>\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p></a></div>\n</blockquote>\n<p><script async src=\"//platform.instagram.com/en_US/embeds.js\"></script></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">中でも注目は、特別企画「メタルラボ ～廃材アートワークショップ～」。関市内の工場から生まれた金属廃材を使い、自分だけのアート作品づくりに挑戦できます。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_37104\" style=\"width: 1165px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-37104\" class=\"wp-image-37104 size-full\" src=\"https://kani.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/257/2026/07/P4160177.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1155\" height=\"1391\" srcset=\"https://kani.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/257/2026/07/P4160177.jpg 1155w, https://kani.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/257/2026/07/P4160177-768x925.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1155px) 100vw, 1155px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-37104\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">加茂郡七宗町にある飲食店「かじかの里・幸の池」で撮影した まつやまたかしさんの作品</p></div>\n<p>講師を務めるのは、漫画家・鳥山明さんの元アシスタントとして知られる、まつやまたかしさん。直接指導を受けられる貴重なワークショップとあって、ファンやものづくりに興味のある方にとっては見逃せない機会となりそうです。</p>\n<p>まつやまたかしさんに会えることを楽しみにしている方も多いのではないでしょうか。</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-37105\" src=\"https://kani.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/257/2026/07/P2180058.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" srcset=\"https://kani.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/257/2026/07/P2180058.jpg 1280w, https://kani.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/257/2026/07/P2180058-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /></p>\n<p>商店街の活気と、関市ならではのものづくり文化の両方を楽しめる一日となりそうです。夏休みのお出かけ先として、ご家族や友人と足を運んでみてはいかがでしょうか。</p>\n<p>関市本町通りはこちら↓</p>\n<div class=\"googlemaps\">\n\t\t\t\t<iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\"  src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d6497.505960802089!2d136.9204433!3d35.485655099999995!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x6003041098ca36c9:0x7684c05708762f1b!2z5bKQ6Zic55yM6Zai5biCIOacrOeUuumAmuOCig!5e0!3m2!1sja!2sjp!4v1784639518384!5m2!1sja!2sjp\"></iframe>\n\t\t\t</div>\n<p>せきてらすはこちら↓</p>\n<div class=\"googlemaps\">\n\t\t\t\t<iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\"  src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3248.899637799576!2d136.9152985!3d35.4820269!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x6003058c86eef65d:0x72ab0544f5fc5378!2z44Gb44GN44Gm44KJ44GZ!5e0!3m2!1sja!2sjp!4v1784639548445!5m2!1sja!2sjp\"></iframe>\n\t\t\t</div>\n"
